###
   ███████  ███      ███  ████████ 
  ███       ███      ███  ███   ███
  ███       ███      ███  ████████ 
  ███       ███      ███  ███      
   ███████  ███████  ███  ███      
  
  tests the clipboard fallback path, never the system clipboard
###

use .. ◆ clip

# nothing here sets opt.system, so clip only touches its own buffer

▸ clip

    ▸ has

        clip.has ''                      ▸ false
        clip.has 'definitely-not-a-tool' ▸ false
        clip.has 'sh'                    ▸ true # sh is on every posix box

    ▸ detect

        tool = clip.detect()
        known = tool in ['wl' 'xsel' 'xclip' 'none']
        known ▸ true

        # the answer is cached, so a second call cannot change it
        clip.detect() ▸ tool

